scandaleuses.

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:03.960
Racistes.

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:04.960
Violentes.

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:05.960
Immondes.

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:08.909
Et c'est ce que je vous disais,

00:21:08.909 --> 00:21:10.050
